#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:43
msgid ""
"The controlling computer no longer stays silent when the user of the "
"controlled one has turned the speech of their NVDA off. Add remote audio, so "
"that the controlling computer can hear what the controlled one is playing, "
"application by application, without any program other than NVDA. Add screen "
"sharing of the controlled computer, with mouse control when its user allows "
"it. Add a chunked file transfer which is no longer limited to 10 MB, with "
"progress, speed and a SHA-256 check."
